<title>UK: Britain asks views on Boeing-Rockwell deal.</title>
<headline>Britain asks views on Boeing-Rockwell deal.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Office of Fair Trading on Monday invited views on the competition implications of Boeing Co's acquisition of Rockwell's aerospace and defence business.</p>
<p>It will decide on the basis of these views whether the deal qualifies for an official anti-trust investigation.</p>
<p>Boeing's purchase of Rockwell's assets was completed on December 6.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
